{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.QStandardRogersSzego","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.QStandardRogersSzego","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Machinery.QPochhammer","lean:module:QOU.Mass.BindingQHermiteOscillator","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.BigOperators.Group.Finset.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecialFunctions.Pow.Real"],"declarations":4,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.qBinomial_pascal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.qBinomial_pascal","kind":"theorem","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/QStandardRogersSzego.lean#L49-L81","doc":"**Standard q-Pascal** for the `(q;q)` Gaussian binomial (`q > 1`, `m`-parametrised,\n`n = k+1+m`): `[k+m+2 choose k+1]_q = [k+1+m choose k]_q + q^{k+1}·[k+1+m choose k+1]_q`.\nClean (no `q^{±}` half-powers) — this is the form that drives the *standard* Rogers–Szegő\nthree-term recurrence. From the `(q;q)` addition `1−q^{(k+1)+(m+1)} = (1−q^{k+1})+q^{k+1}(1−q^{m+1})`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.qPochhammerDiag_ne_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.qPochhammerDiag_ne_zero","kind":"theorem","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/QStandardRogersSzego.lean#L41-L47","doc":"**(q;q)_n ≠ 0 for q > 1** (no root-of-unity vanishing). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.one_sub_pow_succ_ne_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.one_sub_pow_succ_ne_zero","kind":"theorem","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/QStandardRogersSzego.lean#L35-L39","doc":"For `q > 1`, every factor `1 − q^{n+1} < 0`, hence `≠ 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.qPochhammerDiag_succ_q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.qPochhammerDiag_succ_q","kind":"theorem","line":27,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/QStandardRogersSzego.lean#L27-L33","doc":"**(q;q) diagonal recursion** `(q;q)_{n+1} = (q;q)_n · (1 − q^{n+1})`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}